  "question": {
    "text": "<p>If <math> <mrow> <mtext>l</mtext> <mtext>n</mtext> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mi>x</mi> <mo>+</mo> <mi>y</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mi>x</mi> <mi>y</mi> <mtext>,</mtext> <mo>then</mo> <msup> <mi>y</mi> <mo>′</mo> </msup> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>0</mn> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math> is equal to</p>\r",
    "image": null
